As far as i can tell _seemingly_ since #1498, `@tsoaModel` has lost its meaning for dealing with duplicated model names, when using the js-doc annotation for respecifying types imported from libraries for TSOA.

This _seems_ to be a follow-up on #1516.

## Sorting

- **I'm submitting a ...**

